**Unpacked version:** Each `texture2D()` call returns a `vec4`, but only one channel is used. The other 3 channels are wasted bandwidth.

**Packed version:** All 4 channels of the returned `vec4` contain meaningful data (4 different pixel values). This achieves 100% utilization of the texture fetch bandwidth.

