| Metric | Unpacked Version | Packed Version | Improvement |
|--------|-----------------|----------------|-------------|
| Texture reads per output pixel | 1 | 0.25 | 4x fewer |
| Memory bandwidth (1920x1080 output) | ~8.3 MB/frame | ~2.1 MB/frame | 75% reduction |
| Texture memory footprint (1024x1024 source) | 4 MB | 1 MB | 75% reduction |
| Cache line utilization | ~25% (1 of 4 channels used) | 100% (all 4 channels used) | 4x better |
